;
; How Understory files a water reading in MYRA (understory_rules.h UR4):
; its day (days since 1970), its source (1 mains, 2 well, 3 rain, 4
; surface) and the litres drawn that day from that source.
^ZXUNDERWATER(day:i6, source:i1) = litres:i9!
